<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: #4F46E5; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-top: none; }
        .button { display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background: #4F46E5; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin-top: 20px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h2>Course Enrollment Confirmed</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
            <p>You have successfully been enrolled in the course: <strong>{{courseName}}</strong>.</p>
            <p>You can now access your course materials, track your attendance, and more via your student dashboard.</p>
            <a href="{{frontendUrl}}/student/courses" class="button">Go to My Courses</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
